"},"AVGO.q.risk.3":{"c":"AVGO","kind":"risk","quote":"Winning business in the semiconductor solutions industry is an unpredictable process that is often lengthy in time and requires us to incur significant expenses, evolve our business strategy or adopt a new business model, which may negatively impact our results of operations, gross margin or cash flows.","source":"AVGO-0001730168-25-000121","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-12-18","proof":"d197b10f33caa7d96351c294a95c057e9e0dd091c527857cacc25abc5a21095e"},"AVGO.q.risk.4":{"c":"AVGO","kind":"risk","quote":"The amount and frequency of our stock repurchases may fluctuate.","source":"AVGO-0001730168-25-000121","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-12-18","proof":"a54b1b8dd65113edb726f88dd57e14d6672874a26f4b82050068f29593935d9a"},"AVGO.q.riskgone.0":{"c":"AVGO","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Failure to realize the benefits expected from the VMware Merger could adversely affect our business and the value of our common stock.","source":"AVGO-0001730168-24-000139","section":"Risk factors","date":"2024-12-20","proof":"bff08d7aca95dfa32b5c1bd39dc52f5503228ad9e139619d14060b0ea03adf73"},"AVGO.q.riskgone.1":{"c":"AVGO","kind":"risk-was","quote":"We operate in the highly cyclical semiconductor industry.","source":"AVGO-0001730168-24-000139","section":"Risk factors","date":"2024-12-20","proof":"14f2579a5e28feae560a12c8ecee749fbc3e027397ce931bb572ece64498ad98"},"AVGO.q.riskgone.2":{"c":"AVGO","kind":"risk-was","quote":"We make investments in research and development and the slow or unsuccessful return of our investments could materially adversely affect our business, financial condition and results of operations.","source":"AVGO-0001730168-24-000139","section":"Risk factors","date":"2024-12-20","proof":"c61cd22bfff45068c6ba7250c275d464b9a3c8f4cce186a4aaeb323359c907ff"},"AVGO.q.riskgone.3":{"c":"AVGO","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Winning business in the semiconductor solutions industry is subject to a lengthy process that often requires us to incur significant expense, from which we may ultimately generate no revenue.","source":"AVGO-0001730168-24-000139","section":"Risk factors","date":"2024-12-20","proof":"b84e836a3feab8586faaa7a84bb792510c0f2cba522d6b72858218803630672b"},"AVGO.q.riskrw.0":{"c":"AVGO","kind":"risk","quote":"A significant reduction in demand from certain customers or loss of one or more of our significant customers may adversely affect our business.","source":"AVGO-0001730168-25-000121","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-12-18","proof":"0676e4473fd6f4fbfb829a6c294a75866930ef3b6e061b8956fbe19cae7406df"},"AVGO.q.riskrwwas.0":{"c":"AVGO","kind":"risk-was","quote":"The majority of our sales have historically come from a small number of customers and a reduction in demand or loss of one or more of our significant customers may adversely affect our business.","source":"AVGO-0001730168-24-000139","section":"Risk factors","date":"2024-12-20","proof":"27653a73f17360c3ed3065333e3d2dba6f0e0b068007cc66ab9a77e75adeec2b"},"AVGO.q.riskrw.1":{"c":"AVGO","kind":"risk","quote":"Our gross margin is dependent on a number of factors, including our product mix, adoption of a new business model, price erosion, level of capacity utilization and commodity prices.","source":"AVGO-0001730168-25-000121","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-12-18","proof":"f2c1a711465b32b13c846744323c28a4a01bfafc3abc0c132ae92c86baccfa70"},"AVGO.q.riskrwwas.1":{"c":"AVGO","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Our gross margin is dependent on a number of factors, including our product mix, price erosion, acquisitions we may make, level of capacity utilization and commodity prices.","source":"AVGO-0001730168-24-000139","section":"Risk factors","date":"2024-12-20","proof":"4f124e3a19718815679d0d37469e6c8b7372eec434f259558c7cffd7deca71e7"},"AVGO.q.riskrw.2":{"c":"AVGO","kind":"risk","quote":"A prolonged disruption of our or our customers’ or suppliers’ facilities or other significant operations could have a material adverse effect 